// An index the compiler settles needs no check: the length is part of the type
// and the index is written down, so the comparison would be one whose answer is
// in the program.
//
// The status here pins the addressing and says nothing about the folding: a
// folded index and a checked one compute the same answer, so no status could.
// What the absence rests on is a test in lowering that counts the checks a
// module holds, in both directions -- either alone is met by a compiler that
// never checks or by one that always does.
//
// A numeric array element produces a snapshot when used as the result.
// The array remains available after that observation.
fn main() -> UInt8 {
    let xs: [UInt8; 3] = [4, 5, 6]
    xs[1]
}
